<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFDF5">
  <meta name="description" content="AdHello Reviews App — collect 5-star Google reviews on every job, manage customers &amp; field work, and turn happy customers into referrals. 30-day free trial, no credit card.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="AdHello Reviews App — grow reviews &amp; referrals">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Collect 5-star reviews on every job. Manage customers and jobs. Turn happy customers into referrals. 30 days free — no credit card.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <title>AdHello Reviews App · Start your 30-day trial</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css?v=<%= typeof assetVersion !== 'undefined' ? assetVersion : '1' %>">
  <%- include('partials/tailwind_css', { twVariant: 'standalone' }) %>
  <style>
    /* Match AdHello.io marketing tokens: cream #FFFDF5, ink #1f242e, yellow #facc15 / #eab308 */
    :root {
      --fa-yellow: #facc15;
      --fa-yellow-hot: #eab308;
      --fa-ink: #1f242e;
      --fa-muted: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.75);
      --fa-muted-soft: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.6);
      --fa-cream: #FFFDF5;
      --fa-card: #ffffff;
      --fa-line: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.1);
      --fa-font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --fa-display: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --fa-btn-radius: 12px;
      --fa-btn-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    body.fa-sales {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
      background: var(--fa-cream);
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .fa-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .fa-wrap { padding: 0 1.75rem; } }

    .fa-nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.95);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.08);
    }
    .fa-nav__inner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;
      min-height: 3.75rem; max-width: 80rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .fa-nav__brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fa-ink); min-width: 0; }
    .fa-nav__brand img { height: 2.35rem; width: auto; border-radius: 0.55rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .fa-nav__mark {
      font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--fa-ink);
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .fa-nav__mark small {
      display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); margin-top: 0.05rem;
    }
    .fa-nav__cta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-height: 2.4rem; padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem; border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius);
      background: var(--fa-yellow); color: var(--fa-ink); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: var(--fa-btn-shadow);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .fa-nav__cta:hover { background: var(--fa-yellow-hot); }

    .fa-hero {
      padding: 2.25rem 0 1.5rem;
      background: var(--fa-cream);
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .fa-hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2.25rem; } }
    .fa-hero__grid {
      display: grid; gap: 2rem; align-items: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 960px) {
      .fa-hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.95fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    }
    .fa-kicker {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fa-ink);
      background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.22);
      border-radius: 9999px; padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .fa-hero h1 {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.75rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--fa-yellow-hot); }
    .fa-hero__lead {
      margin: 1.25rem 0 0; max-width: 36rem;
      font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.625; color: var(--fa-muted); font-weight: 400;
    }
    .fa-hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .fa-btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-height: 3.1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius); border: 0;
      background: var(--fa-yellow); color: var(--fa-ink); text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900; font-size: 1rem;
      box-shadow: var(--fa-btn-shadow);
    }
    .fa-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--fa-yellow-hot); }
    .fa-btn-ghost {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-height: 3.1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1.35rem; border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line); background: #fff; color: var(--fa-ink);
      text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;
      box-shadow: var(--fa-btn-shadow);
    }
    .fa-hero__proof {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.55rem 1.1rem; margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
    }
    .fa-hero__proof span::before { content: '✓'; color: #10b981; font-weight: 900; margin-right: 0.35rem; }

    .fa-phone {
      position: relative; margin: 0 auto; width: min(100%, 20rem);
      border-radius: 1.25rem; background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -28px rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.28);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.15rem 1.4rem; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .fa-phone::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto 0; height: 4.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.45), #fff 72%);
    }
    .fa-phone__bar {
      position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .fa-phone__dot {
      width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; border-radius: 9999px;
      background: var(--fa-yellow); color: var(--fa-ink);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px;
    }
    .fa-phone__bar strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-phone__bar small { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); font-weight: 600; }
    .fa-phone__row {
      position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.85rem; background: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.03); margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    .fa-phone__ico {
      width: 1.85rem; height: 1.85rem; border-radius: 0.55rem; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-phone__row strong { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-phone__row span { display: block; margin-top: 0.15rem; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); line-height: 1.35; }

    .fa-section { padding: 2.5rem 0; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .fa-section { padding: 3.25rem 0; } }
    .fa-section h2 {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.5vw, 2.15rem); letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-section__lead { margin: 0.65rem 0 0; max-width: 36rem; color: var(--fa-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.55; }
    .fa-features {
      display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.75rem;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .fa-features { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    @media (min-width: 960px) { .fa-features { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
    .fa-feature {
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--fa-btn-shadow);
    }
    .fa-feature__ico {
      width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.22);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-feature h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-feature p { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--fa-muted); }

    .fa-steps {
      display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.75rem;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .fa-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
    .fa-step {
      position: relative; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem 1.4rem;
      box-shadow: var(--fa-btn-shadow);
    }
    .fa-step__n {
      width: 2rem; height: 2rem; border-radius: 9999px; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      background: var(--fa-yellow); color: var(--fa-ink);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px;
    }
    .fa-step h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-step p { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--fa-muted); }

    .fa-cta-band {
      padding: 2.75rem 0 3.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.12) 40%, rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.18));
    }
    .fa-cta-band__intro { text-align: center; max-width: 36rem; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; }
    .fa-cta-band__intro h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.8vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-cta-band__intro p { margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: var(--fa-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }

    .fa-card {
      max-width: 28rem; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff;
      border-radius: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.18); padding: 2rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .fa-card { padding: 2.5rem; } }
    .fa-brand-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.35rem; }
    .fa-brand-row img { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.7rem; }
    .fa-brand-row strong {
      display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--fa-ink); line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .fa-brand-row span {
      display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    .fa-card > h1, .fa-card .fa-card-title {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--fa-display); font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-card > .fa-card-lead {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-field { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
    .fa-field label { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .fa-field label .opt { font-weight: 600; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.45); }
    .fa-field input { width: 100%; height: 2.9rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--fa-line); background: #fff; padding: 0 0.9rem; font-size: 16px; color: var(--fa-ink); outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--fa-font); }
    .fa-field input:focus { border-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28); }
    .fa-perks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem 1rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-muted); }
    .fa-perks span::before { content: '✓'; color: #10b981; font-weight: 900; margin-right: 0.35rem; }
    .fa-terms {
      margin-top: 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-terms input {
      margin-top: 0.15rem; width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0;
      accent-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot); cursor: pointer;
    }
    .fa-terms label { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fa-muted); }
    .fa-terms a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; }
    .fa-terms-details {
      margin-top: 0.65rem; border: 1px solid var(--fa-line); border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.8); padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary {
      cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; color: var(--fa-ink); list-style: none;
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .fa-terms-details[open] summary { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .fa-terms-details ul { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
    .fa-terms-details li + li { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .fa-btn { width: 100%; height: 3.5rem; margin-top: 2.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 0; border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius); background: #facc15; color: #1f242e; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.15s; font-family: var(--fa-font); }
    .fa-btn:hover { background: #eab308; }
    .fa-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.72; cursor: wait; pointer-events: none; background: #e5c412; }
    .fa-foot { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); line-height: 1.45; }
    .fa-foot a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    .fa-errors { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: #b91c1c; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .fa-errors li + li { margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .fa-ok { background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; color: #065f46; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; }

    .fa-footer {
      padding: 1.75rem 0 2.25rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.08);
      text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .fa-footer a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }

    @media (max-width: 639px) {
      .fa-nav__mark { max-width: 11rem; }
      .fa-hero__actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .fa-btn-primary, .fa-btn-ghost { width: 100%; }
      .fa-phone { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
      .fa-card { border-radius: 1.1rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
      .fa-perks { gap: 0.35rem 0.85rem; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .fa-hero__grid > div:first-child {
        animation: fa-rise 0.55s ease-out both;
      }
      .fa-phone {
        animation: fa-rise 0.65s ease-out 0.08s both;
      }
      .fa-feature, .fa-step {
        animation: fa-rise 0.5s ease-out both;
      }
      .fa-feature:nth-child(2), .fa-step:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.06s; }
      .fa-feature:nth-child(3), .fa-step:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
      .fa-feature:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.18s; }
      .fa-btn-primary, .fa-btn, .fa-nav__cta {
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }
      .fa-btn-primary:hover, .fa-btn:hover, .fa-nav__cta:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      @keyframes fa-rise {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="fa-sales">
  <% const _f = form || {}; const _brand = typeof brand !== 'undefined' && brand ? brand : { appName: 'AdHello' }; %>
  <% const _login = typeof loginHref !== 'undefined' ? loginHref : '/m/login'; %>
  <% const _trial = typeof trialSignupHref !== 'undefined' ? trialSignupHref : '/signup'; %>

  <header class="fa-nav">
    <div class="fa-nav__inner">
      <a class="fa-nav__brand" href="/app">
        <img src="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" alt="AdHello" width="38" height="38" />
        <span class="fa-nav__mark">AdHello<small>Reviews app</small></span>
      </a>
      <% if (!sent) { %>
      <a class="fa-nav__cta" href="#start">Start trial</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </header>

  <% if (sent) { %>
  <main class="fa-cta-band" style="min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center">
    <div class="fa-wrap" style="width:100%">
      <div class="fa-card">
        <div class="fa-brand-row">
          <img src="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" alt="AdHello" width="40" height="40" />
          <div>
            <strong>AdHello</strong>
            <span>Reviews app</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="fa-card-title">Check your phone</h1>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">If that number or email is valid, your reviews app link is on its way. Open it, then Share → Add to Home Screen.</p>
        <div class="fa-ok mt-5" role="status">Link sent. It can take a minute. Already have it? <a class="font-semibold underline" href="<%= _login %>">Get a fresh link</a>.</div>
        <p class="fa-foot" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Want the full workspace (leads, SMS, email, GHL CRM)? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start a free trial</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <% } else { %>

  <section class="fa-hero">
    <div class="fa-wrap fa-hero__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="fa-kicker">★ 30-day free trial — reviews &amp; business app</p>
        <h1>Grow more reviews &amp; referrals. <em>Grow Your Business.</em></h1>
        <p class="fa-hero__lead">Collect 5-star reviews on every job. Turn happy customers into referrals. Manage customers and field work — white-labeled to your business, no app store download.</p>
        <div class="fa-hero__actions">
          <a class="fa-btn-primary" href="#start">Start your 30-day trial</a>
          <a class="fa-btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <div class="fa-hero__proof">
          <span>Reviews on every job</span>
          <span>Customers &amp; jobs</span>
          <span>Referral network</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fa-phone" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="fa-phone__bar">
          <span class="fa-phone__dot">A</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Your Reviews app</strong>
            <small>Home screen · white-labeled</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fa-phone__row">
          <span class="fa-phone__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2.5l2.7 5.5 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1L12 16.4 6.6 19.3l1-6.1L3.2 8.9l6.1-.9L12 2.5z"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Request a Google review</strong>
            <span>Text a link before you leave the job site.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fa-phone__row">
          <span class="fa-phone__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.5 20.25a7.5 7.5 0 0115 0"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Customers &amp; jobs</strong>
            <span>Track jobs from estimate to done.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fa-phone__row">
          <span class="fa-phone__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12h15m0 0l-5.25-5.25M19.5 12l-5.25 5.25"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Send a referral</strong>
            <span>Turn a happy customer into your next lead.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fa-section" id="features">
    <div class="fa-wrap">
      <h2>Built for the job site — not another CRM login</h2>
      <p class="fa-section__lead">The Reviews app is for owners and crews who need reviews, customers, and referrals on their phone. No Agency OS workspace required.</p>
      <div class="fa-features">
        <article class="fa-feature">
          <div class="fa-feature__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2.5l2.7 5.5 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1L12 16.4 6.6 19.3l1-6.1L3.2 8.9l6.1-.9L12 2.5z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>5-star reviews</h3>
          <p>Ask for a Google review the moment the job wraps — while they’re still smiling.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fa-feature">
          <div class="fa-feature__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Customers &amp; jobs</h3>
          <p>Keep contacts, jobs, notes, and photos in one place your whole crew can use.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fa-feature">
          <div class="fa-feature__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 12a3 3 0 116 0 3 3 0 01-6 0zm9 0a3 3 0 10.001-.001A3 3 0 0016.5 12zM3.75 19.5a5.25 5.25 0 0110.5 0m-1.5 0a5.25 5.25 0 0110.5 0"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Referrals</h3>
          <p>Send and receive referrals with partners — grow without cold calling strangers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fa-feature">
          <div class="fa-feature__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 10.5l9-7 9 7V20a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 013 20v-9.5z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Your brand on Home Screen</h3>
          <p>White-labeled to your business. Share → Add to Home Screen. No App Store wait.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fa-section" id="how" style="padding-top:0.5rem">
    <div class="fa-wrap">
      <h2>Live in minutes</h2>
      <p class="fa-section__lead">Text yourself the link, add it to your Home Screen, and start requesting reviews today.</p>
      <div class="fa-steps">
        <article class="fa-step">
          <span class="fa-step__n">1</span>
          <h3>Get your trial link</h3>
          <p>Enter your name, business, and mobile. We’ll text your private app link — no credit card.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fa-step">
          <span class="fa-step__n">2</span>
          <h3>Add to Home Screen</h3>
          <p>Open the link on your phone, then Share → Add to Home Screen. It feels like a real app.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fa-step">
          <span class="fa-step__n">3</span>
          <h3>Ask for reviews</h3>
          <p>After every job, tap Request a review. Track customers, jobs, and referrals from the same app.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fa-cta-band" id="start">
    <div class="fa-wrap">
      <div class="fa-cta-band__intro">
        <h2>Start your 30-day trial</h2>
        <p>Request Google reviews, manage customers and jobs, and send referrals. Free for 30 days — no Agency OS workspace.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fa-card">
        <div class="fa-brand-row">
          <img src="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" alt="AdHello" width="40" height="40" />
          <div>
            <strong>AdHello</strong>
            <span>Reviews app</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h1 class="fa-card-title">Start your 30-day trial</h1>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">Request Google reviews, manage customers and jobs, and send referrals. 30 days free — no credit card. No Agency OS workspace.</p>
        <div class="fa-perks mt-4"><span>30-day trial</span><span>Reviews</span><span>Customers &amp; jobs</span></div>

        <% if (errors && errors.length) { %>
          <ul class="fa-errors" role="alert">
            <% errors.forEach(function (e) { %><li><%= e %></li><% }) %>
          </ul>
        <% } %>

        <form method="post" action="/app" class="mt-2" id="fa-form" autocomplete="on">
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-name">Your name</label>
            <input id="fa-name" name="contactName" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" value="<%= _f.contactName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-company">Business name</label>
            <input id="fa-company" name="companyName" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160" value="<%= _f.companyName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-phone">Mobile number</label>
            <input id="fa-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="40" value="<%= _f.phone || '' %>" placeholder="We’ll text your app link">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-email">Email <span class="opt">(if you prefer email)</span></label>
            <input id="fa-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200" value="<%= _f.email || '' %>">
          </div>

          <div class="fa-terms">
            <input id="fa-terms" name="acceptTerms" type="checkbox" value="on" required <%= _f.acceptTerms ? 'checked' : '' %>>
            <label for="fa-terms">
              I agree to the <a href="#fa-terms-details">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>: AdHello Reviews is a
              <strong>pay-per-performance</strong> model. I will pay commission on leads I receive through the app
              <strong>after I approve them</strong>.
            </label>
          </div>
          <details class="fa-terms-details" id="fa-terms-details">
            <summary>Terms &amp; Conditions — pay-per-performance</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>The Reviews app trial and core tools may be free; lead delivery is <strong>pay-per-performance</strong>.</li>
              <li>When you receive a lead through the app, you choose whether to <strong>approve</strong> (accept) it.</li>
              <li>Approving a lead means you agree to pay the applicable <strong>commission</strong> for that lead.</li>
              <li>Declining a lead does not create a commission obligation for that lead.</li>
              <li>By checking the box above and submitting this form, you accept these Terms &amp; Conditions.</li>
            </ul>
          </details>

          <button type="submit" class="fa-btn" id="fa-submit">Text me my trial link</button>
        </form>
        <script>
          (function () {
            var form = document.getElementById('fa-form');
            var btn = document.getElementById('fa-submit');
            if (!form || !btn) return;
            var locked = false;
            form.addEventListener('submit', function (ev) {
              if (locked) {
                ev.preventDefault();
                return;
              }
              locked = true;
              btn.disabled = true;
              btn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
              btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
            });
            if (document.querySelector('.fa-errors')) {
              var start = document.getElementById('start');
              if (start) start.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
            }
          })();
        </script>

        <p class="fa-foot">Already in a network? <a class="underline" href="<%= _login %>">Get your link</a>. Need leads + CRM? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start Agency OS trial</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <% } %>

  <footer class="fa-footer">
    <div class="fa-wrap">
      <p>© AdHello · <a href="https://adhello.io">adhello.io</a> · Reviews app trial at <a href="/app">reviews.adhello.io</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
